    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Haircuts, dentistry, bloodletting, and surgery\u2014if it takes a steady hand and a razor, you can do it. You may have taken to the road to expand your skills or test yourself against a world that leaves your patients so battered and bruised.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Wisdom, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Medicine skill and the Surgery Lore skill. You gain the Risky Surgery skill feat."
    },
